<h1>Reset your password</h1>
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>We received a request to reset your GateML password. Click the button below — this link is valid for <strong>1 hour</strong>.</p>

<p style="text-align:center;margin:28px 0;">
  <a class="btn" href="{{resetUrl}}">Reset Password</a>
</p>

<p style="font-size:13px;color:#555;">Or copy and paste this URL:</p>
<p class="code" style="word-break:break-all;font-size:12px;">{{resetUrl}}</p>

<hr class="divider" />
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#555;">If you didn't request a password reset, your account is safe — no changes were made.</p>
